So, based upon results I felt that the cvs translation thingy just
wasn't working.  Not enough people were using it for it to provide what
I felt the community wanted and needed.

I had never used a Wiki before, until Jay set his up.  I find I like
them.

So, it occured to me to put the translations there.

I've only moved Alice so far; it's a slow process, and I want to guage
user acceptance for a bit.

Please take a look.  Please help.  Dig in.

